  The article gives the date of the burglary as 12 (the night of the 12th) but does not name a month; the draft says 'கடந்த 12ஆம் தேதி' which is consistent, but the slide text 'கடந்த <b>12</b> நள்ளிரவு' is malformed Tamil with 'நுழைந்தனர' (typo, missing ி/ன்) in slide 1 line 2
  Slide 1 line 2 contains the typo 'நுழைந்தனர' instead of 'நுழைந்தனர்', an ungrammatical/garbled word ending
  The draft says 'பள்ளிப்பாளையம் காவல் துணை கண்காணிப்பாளர்' (Deputy Superintendent of Police) in the reel script, while the article only says 'டி.எஸ்.பி.' – acceptable expansion, but the caption adds 'சப்-டிவிஷனுக்குட்பட்ட' which the article only mentions as the area of the DSP's advice, so the caption's rendering of the geographic scope is slightly changed
  The reel script says the arrests were of people 'வீட்டுத் திருட்டில் ஈடுபட்ட 3 பேர்' and the 'maximum' sentence structure mixes the house theft and arrest facts into one opening sentence, combining two facts (the theft and the arrest) in one sentence
  The caption's 'நாள்: 12 நள்ளிரவு (கொள்ளை), 18 (கைது)' line omits the month, and the 'வீட்டுக்குள்' wording in the caption differs from the article's 'வீட்டிற்குள்' only stylistically, while the caption's statement that the arrests were for the 'இந்தத் திருட்டில்' is consistent
